{"unit_id":"tag:05XX:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有了这一术语，我们得到下述结果，它推广了“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠","context":"章节标题暂译，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05XY:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism），其所连接的叠（stacks）以群胚（groupoids）为纤维，位于<MATH_0004>之上。若\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006>是代数的（algebraic）（见上文），\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0007>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的","context":"代数态射性质暂译，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05XY:proof","translation":"由假设（1），存在一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>和一个对象（object）<MATH_0002>，属于<MATH_0003>，位于<MATH_0004>之上，使得对应的<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>光滑（smooth）且满射（surjective）。于是\n<MATH_0007>\n由假设（2）是一个代数叠（algebraic stack）。选取一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>及一个满射（surjective）光滑（smooth）的<MATH_0009>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>。投影（projection）<MATH_0011>作为态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>的基变换（base change），是满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）的，见“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0001>。于是复合（composition）\n<MATH_0013>\n作为满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）的态射（morphisms）的复合（composition），是满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）的，见“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0002>。因此，<MATH_0014>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack），这是由“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0003>得出的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"}],"u