{"unit_id":"tag:06CG:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism），其所连接的叠（stacks）以群胚（groupoids）为纤维，位于<MATH_0004>之上。若<MATH_0005>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack），且<MATH_0006>可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable），则<MATH_0007>是代数的（algebraic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的","context":"代数态射性质暂译，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06CG:proof","translation":"选取一个可表的（representable）叠（stack），其纤维为群胚（groupoids），记为<MATH_0001>，并选取一个满射（surjective）光滑（smooth）的<MATH_0002>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为一个概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>的一个对象（object），位于<MATH_0007>之上。<MATH_0008>-纤维积（fibre products）之间的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0009>\n可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable），且满射（surjective）、光滑（smooth），因为它是<MATH_0010>的基变换（base change），见“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>。由我们关于<MATH_0011>的对角（diagonal）的条件可知，这个态射（morphism）的源可由一个代数空间（algebraic space）表示（representable），见“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0003>。因此其目标是一个代数叠（algebraic stack），这是由“代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）”中的引理<REF_0004>得出的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"叠的可表性暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"暂译，待决"