{"unit_id":"tag:05XZ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给定态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>，我们可以考虑如下函子（functor）：它将概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>（位于<MATH_0003>之上）对应于截面（sections）<MATH_0004>的集合（set），这些截面属于基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>，它来自态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。本节证明关于此函子（functor）的一些预备引理。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"暂译，待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译，待决"}],"notes":[]}
